  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a8fc31f055cc5664f9cccd421092423b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  phaseOneDialog:
  - A fire has started to the Northwest and our community is in danger!
  - Some households need to make considerations for family, pets, and their property,
    and everyone needs to prepare to evacuate.
  - 'Give instructions to each house to help them make the best decision. '
  - 'Tap the question mark button at the top of the screen to learn more about each
    house type and unlock more options. '
  - 'Once you have given instructions to each house type, press the play button at
    the top to run the simulation and see the evacuation. '
  - 'Remember that winds can change quickly, making fire direction difficult to predict,
    and embers can be blown long distances to catch houses on fire. '
  endDialog:
  - generated
  - A local news story has more details based on your choices.
  dialog: {fileID: 1903638292}
  houseDestroyed: 0
  acresDestroyed: 0
  done: 0
  images: []
  localNews: {fileID: 1907075366}
  timer: {fileID: 0}
